{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53994","headline":"将示灭说传法偈 · 义玄","name":"将示灭说传法偈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"沿流不止问如何？真照无偏（《五灯会元》、《林间录》作「边」）说似他。\n离相离名人不禀，吹毛用了急还（《林间录》、《五灯会元》作「须」）磨。\n（见《天圣广灯录》卷十、《五灯会元》卷十一、《林间录》卷下）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"义玄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53994.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53994","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}